UID:uEj5pknVToV4w5bPd_1Ta
SUMMARY:Free Watch Party: Bronze Final
DTSTAMP:20260711T054928Z
DTSTART:20260718T140000Z
DESCRIPTION:Not every story ends with a trophy\, but these two teams aren’t
	 done fighting. The Third Place Match is a celebration of grit\, pride\, a
	nd everything that makes this sport great. Come honor the journey with us.
	 Kickoff for this free watch party is at 4:00 p.m. \nFood and Beverage Con
	cessions: Visit Franky’s for a gourmet hot dog or sausage and cool down wi
	th a popsicle from Frios Gourmet Pops. Non-alcoholic drinks from Coca-Cola
